    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Verticillium wilt incidence on is calculated in plant mature stage, as the ratio between the number of infected plants and the total number of plants. OR: Disease incidence = No. of infected plants x 100 Total no. of plant assessed</ns1:definition>
